WEBVTT

00:02.130 --> 00:11.710
That night, there was a red star shining in the sky...
a star known as the Scarlet Calamity. A bad omen.

00:13.460 --> 00:18.080
Children of the royal family mustn't be born
when the inauspicious star is visible.

00:18.920 --> 00:24.130
In accordance with this rule,
the king sentenced the fourth princess to death.

00:25.540 --> 00:30.920
Duke Crystalia, however, knew of the situation.
He pleaded with the king not to kill her.

00:31.880 --> 00:36.580
The infant was buried in the forest...
or at least, that was the official story.

00:36.880 --> 00:42.790
One of Duke Crystalia's sons, Lord Edward,
secretly brought her back to his home.

00:43.540 --> 00:47.750
Lord Edward and his wife
had just been blessed with a child of their own.

00:48.210 --> 00:53.250
So, claiming that the two girls were "sisters of the
same age," they welcomed the infant into their family.

00:54.670 --> 00:56.420
As the child grew older,

00:56.420 --> 01:01.830
she became a personal maid to their biological daughter
in order to keep her identity concealed.

01:03.170 --> 01:10.380
My real name is Regina Ray O'ltriese.
My platoonmates are the only ones who know the truth.

01:11.170 --> 01:17.170
I came here hoping to catch a glimpse of my sister
from afar, but this little guy was at the harbor...

01:17.920 --> 01:20.380
That spirit belongs to Princess Altiria, right?

01:21.040 --> 01:25.880
Members of the royal family possess
the spirit medium abilities of Princess Priestesses.

01:26.540 --> 01:31.000
This Carbuncle is a Source Spirit.
Through it, they're able to control the ship.

01:31.630 --> 01:36.170
And the ship is moving, despite the spirit
and the princess having been separated.

01:36.540 --> 01:40.420
Exactly... Which means something
must have happened to her!

01:42.710 --> 01:44.210
She's being held hostage.

01:44.460 --> 01:45.250
What?!

01:45.830 --> 01:47.790
By a cabal of demi-humans.

01:48.250 --> 01:50.130
They've also taken over the banquet hall.

01:50.880 --> 01:52.040
Oh no...

01:52.290 --> 01:57.420
But Miss Selia and the others are handling it
as we speak. You and I can go rescue the princess.

01:57.960 --> 01:59.920
I suspect their ringleader is on the bridge.

02:00.750 --> 02:01.960
Got it.

02:02.290 --> 02:04.130
Let's have this little guy lead the way.

02:11.130 --> 02:14.250
<b>A BOND EVERLASTING</b>

02:18.580 --> 02:20.880
Which direction is the ship heading?

02:25.290 --> 02:31.750
Bet that gun wouldn't be a problem if you could
use your Holy Sword... But the second you do, "BOOM!"

02:33.670 --> 02:34.460
Selia.

02:35.670 --> 02:38.080
I analyzed the bomb's functionality.

02:38.080 --> 02:40.080
Huh? But your Holy Sword...

02:40.500 --> 02:43.790
One of my drones is hidden behind the chandelier.

02:44.250 --> 02:45.750
They haven't noticed it yet.

02:46.000 --> 02:47.250
When did you...?

02:47.750 --> 02:51.790
I was curious about the ship's capabilities,
so it's been active since before the party began.

02:53.500 --> 02:54.250
Look.

02:54.710 --> 02:57.630
That wand sends a signal that triggers detonation.

02:58.670 --> 03:00.750
So if we can block the signal...

03:01.170 --> 03:06.210
But with only one drone jammer,
delaying the explosion is the best I can manage.

03:06.420 --> 03:09.290
Half a second- no... One second is all I need...

03:09.540 --> 03:11.500
Alright then. One second.

03:11.670 --> 03:13.000
Let me prepare myself.

03:25.500 --> 03:26.960
I can't use my Holy Sword...

03:27.710 --> 03:30.330
But with the power of my vampire blood...

03:34.420 --> 03:35.420
They're not here...

03:38.960 --> 03:40.170
Artificial Elementals...

03:42.420 --> 03:45.380
It looks like they locked course
and shut down the control panel.

03:46.000 --> 03:47.210
I can't steer the ship.

03:47.540 --> 03:49.210
Then where did the princess go...?

03:52.540 --> 03:56.460
The princess' voice was briefly audible
through the Carbuncle earlier.

03:56.830 --> 03:59.790
If I could hear it again,
I might be able to get a fix on her location...

04:00.380 --> 04:03.130
So what's stopping you from
reaching out to her, Miss Regina?

04:03.130 --> 04:03.880
Huh?

04:04.130 --> 04:06.580
You can do it, can't you? Since you're also royalty.

04:07.460 --> 04:11.540
Yes, but that would require
revealing my existence to her...

04:11.750 --> 04:13.710
Aren't there more important things at stake?

04:14.080 --> 04:15.920
You came here to save your sister, right?

04:18.210 --> 04:21.750
Y'know, for a kid,
ya sure do talk like an adult sometimes...

04:22.250 --> 04:23.630
It's kind of annoying.

04:24.290 --> 04:26.500
Still, I'll give it a shot.

04:31.540 --> 04:35.170
Your Highness, Princess Altiria... can you hear me?

04:38.420 --> 04:40.580
You've linked with my Carbuncle...?

04:41.460 --> 04:42.920
Who am I speaking to?

04:44.790 --> 04:45.920
I'm...

04:48.130 --> 04:50.670
...a spirit medium. I was just passing by.

04:51.710 --> 04:56.580
I see. Is it alright if I call you "Miss Spirit Medium"?

04:57.040 --> 05:00.000
Sure. Where are you right now?

05:00.630 --> 05:02.500
We're heading towards the flight deck.

05:03.040 --> 05:04.330
I'll be there ASAP!

05:04.710 --> 05:08.210
No, don't worry about me. You have to prioritize the ship.

05:10.460 --> 05:13.380
The course they set takes us straight through a Void reef.

05:13.920 --> 05:18.380
Connect my Carbuncle to the spirit monitoring
system at the heart of the lowermost deck

05:18.750 --> 05:21.670
and take back control as quickly as possible.

05:22.460 --> 05:23.830
The access code is...

05:29.580 --> 05:31.460
Miss Regina, what is that?

05:31.460 --> 05:33.130
It's a Void reef.

05:33.130 --> 05:37.670
The princess wants me to regain control of the ship using
the spirit monitoring system on the lowermost deck.

05:38.000 --> 05:39.210
Where is she right now?

05:39.580 --> 05:42.830
She's on her way to the flight deck. I have to go save her!

05:42.830 --> 05:43.670
But...

05:44.000 --> 05:46.210
Head down to the lower deck, Miss Regina.

05:46.460 --> 05:48.210
I'll rescue the princess myself.

05:48.380 --> 05:50.000
You? On your own?

05:51.000 --> 05:52.130
It's way too-

05:57.710 --> 05:59.000
I'll be fine, I promise.

05:59.210 --> 06:02.040
You're the only one who can regain control
of the ship, Miss Regina.

06:03.750 --> 06:05.250
Keep my sister safe.

06:07.790 --> 06:11.670
Kidnapping princesses is all
in a day's work for a Demon Lord!

06:25.540 --> 06:27.500
On my signal, activate the jammer.

06:27.500 --> 06:28.250
Roger that.

06:28.710 --> 06:31.210
At least allow the children to board the lifeboats!

06:34.630 --> 06:37.670
The autopilot should be able
to shuttle them back to the city.

06:38.750 --> 06:41.040
Wouldja sit down and shuddup?!

06:41.290 --> 06:42.580
Cut it out!

06:42.580 --> 06:45.130
They ain't gonna miss one measly little girl...

06:52.000 --> 06:54.920
My apologies. It seems I dropped a plate.

06:55.210 --> 06:58.500
Wait, when the hell did-?!
What happened to your ropes?!

06:59.040 --> 07:01.210
Couldn't eat with my hands tied, so I removed them.

07:01.960 --> 07:02.960
Why, you...

07:02.960 --> 07:04.250
Are you mocking me?!

07:04.420 --> 07:05.250
Stop!

07:05.250 --> 07:07.250
Her clothes... She's a warrior from Ouran!

07:08.540 --> 07:12.330
Th-those crazy adrenaline junkie bastards
who go around huntin' Voids

07:12.540 --> 07:14.920
as a way of getting revenge for their clan...?!

07:15.960 --> 07:19.500
If "one measly little girl" has to die, why not me?

07:19.790 --> 07:21.830
I'VE got first dibs on this fight!

07:25.580 --> 07:27.580
Alright then, you asked for it!

07:32.000 --> 07:32.750
Dumb brat!

07:32.830 --> 07:34.000
Jakt, light 'em up!

07:34.170 --> 07:35.040
Finé!

07:42.040 --> 07:43.000
Tsk!

07:48.500 --> 07:51.000
Activate! Frost Wolf!

07:52.330 --> 07:53.420
Dammit!

08:08.040 --> 08:11.460
I-it appears my brilliant distraction was successful.

08:12.170 --> 08:15.920
Could've been a little more discreet,
don't you think? Jeez...

08:16.540 --> 08:18.710
Selia, is the kid alright?

08:18.830 --> 08:20.040
I'll contact him right now.

08:23.960 --> 08:25.330
I can't get through...?

08:26.580 --> 08:29.130
There's something weird outside...

08:30.210 --> 08:31.170
Don't tell me...

08:37.040 --> 08:39.250
We're in the middle of a Void reef!

08:39.630 --> 08:40.630
Seriously?!

09:17.420 --> 09:19.080
Make your way to the ship's interior!

09:19.080 --> 09:20.790
This way! Please remain calm!

09:20.790 --> 09:22.330
Miss Selia, can you hear me?

09:22.630 --> 09:24.380
Leo?! Where are you?

09:25.170 --> 09:28.040
I'm using the cat keychain
to communicate with you telepathically.

09:28.380 --> 09:29.130
Really?!

09:29.460 --> 09:31.580
You're my minion now.

09:31.580 --> 09:33.330
This shouldn't come as much of a surprise.

09:33.790 --> 09:35.000
R-right...

09:35.290 --> 09:36.420
What's the situation over there?

09:36.920 --> 09:39.710
We neutralized the demi-humans,
but then Voids showed up...

09:40.130 --> 09:44.830
Miss Regina is on her way to the ship's spirit monitoring
system at the heart of the lowermost deck.

09:44.830 --> 09:46.000
She is?!

09:46.000 --> 09:48.920
She's going to try and regain control,
so you'll need watch her back.

09:49.170 --> 09:51.080
But I have to protect these people!

09:52.670 --> 09:54.540
I'll make arrangements to handle the Voids.

09:55.130 --> 09:56.080
Got it.

09:56.580 --> 09:57.790
Finé!

10:03.500 --> 10:05.830
Where exactly are you taking me?

10:06.250 --> 10:09.830
There are certain people
who have a keen interest in spirits.

10:10.290 --> 10:14.330
To put it another way,
you'll be a plaything for a bunch of sadists.

10:25.460 --> 10:27.000
W-wow, not bad...

10:30.250 --> 10:31.460
Lady Selia!

10:54.330 --> 10:55.750
A Brain Eater...?!

11:03.500 --> 11:05.750
It's way more powerful than a merman-class...

11:08.500 --> 11:09.960
You two focus on the Brain Eater!

11:10.250 --> 11:12.080
I'll deal with the merman Voids!

11:12.880 --> 11:13.710
No...

11:14.420 --> 11:16.080
Let ME take care of this one.

11:16.920 --> 11:19.210
Head inside and protect the civilians!

11:24.380 --> 11:26.000
Don't do anything stupid, okay?!

11:37.420 --> 11:39.540
Demon Sword, Yamichidori...

11:42.210 --> 11:47.130
If I am to vanquish you, I must resort
to a rather frowned-upon ability.

11:47.750 --> 11:50.210
Think of it as an eternal parting gift.

12:06.130 --> 12:07.670
Leave the Voids to me!

12:07.830 --> 12:09.080
I owe you one!

12:25.380 --> 12:28.630
The access code is... "Scarlet Calamity."

12:29.170 --> 12:32.540
To me, it's the name of an awful, ominous star.

12:32.960 --> 12:36.210
But they're also the two words
that I could never hope to forget.

12:38.790 --> 12:39.750
Thank you.

12:44.790 --> 12:46.500
Access ship operating system...

12:46.920 --> 12:51.380
Veer 180 degrees to starboard. Full speed ahead.

12:56.380 --> 12:58.250
D-don't leave me behind!

12:59.040 --> 13:01.000
Hey! C'mon!

13:07.130 --> 13:09.670
The ship is changing course...

13:15.460 --> 13:17.500
Miss Spirit Medium must've done it!

13:24.960 --> 13:26.130
What the hell?!

13:35.250 --> 13:38.420
Did you think I'd let you escape, you conniving swine?

13:39.080 --> 13:43.630
For the crime of terrorizing my kingdom...
you shall be punished.

13:54.960 --> 13:59.000
It's okay... Big Brother Leo will be here to save us soon...

14:03.130 --> 14:03.710
Huh?

14:03.960 --> 14:05.330
Wh-what was that?!

14:17.880 --> 14:21.080
Once again, Master is working
his poor maid to the bone...

14:21.540 --> 14:25.170
But the girl trusts him, so I guess she's not all bad.

14:41.330 --> 14:44.750
You're the one who gave
Demon Swords to the beastmen, yes?

14:45.830 --> 14:48.170
And who in the hell are you?

14:48.790 --> 14:50.500
I am the Demon Lord.

14:50.830 --> 14:51.580
What?

14:52.130 --> 14:53.960
Have you decided to clean up your act yet?

14:54.580 --> 15:00.250
Disrespectful brats like you...
shouldn't go around playing make-believe!

15:03.460 --> 15:04.880
That the best you've got?

15:05.330 --> 15:06.790
I-impossible...!

15:07.250 --> 15:10.460
That spell belongs to the legendary Demon Lord...

15:10.750 --> 15:14.210
Precisely. It's a rudimentary spell that I created.

15:14.790 --> 15:16.830
Which is why it won't work!

15:19.710 --> 15:21.920
What are you trying to accomplish?

15:22.580 --> 15:26.540
C-corrupt Holy Swordsmen... with nothingness...

15:26.540 --> 15:28.670
...f-forge Demon Swords...

15:29.000 --> 15:32.130
...and offer them to the Goddess...

15:32.250 --> 15:34.210
Wait, did you say "goddess"...?

15:34.960 --> 15:37.460
All of the gods perished a thousand years ago.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.710
Who is this goddess you speak of?

15:40.880 --> 15:42.500
Her name is...

15:42.630 --> 15:43.630
I-it's...

15:44.580 --> 15:49.040
I-i-i-it's-

15:51.710 --> 15:52.500
What?!

15:56.420 --> 16:02.500
That's... a Demon Lord Slayer,
the Evil-Thrashing Blade: Zolgstar Mezekis...

16:02.500 --> 16:03.540
Why is it here?!

16:22.750 --> 16:27.210
The legendary weapon itself, consumed
by nothingness and transformed into a Void Lord...

16:28.790 --> 16:32.460
Level 8 sorcery: Al Gu Belzelga!

16:35.960 --> 16:38.960
That blade was bestowed upon the Hero by the gods...

16:39.540 --> 16:44.420
It might be a Void Lord now,
but I guess it hasn't lost its ability to counter sorcery...

16:51.290 --> 16:52.630
It can teleport?!

16:56.750 --> 16:57.580
Dammit!

16:59.630 --> 17:00.500
Huh?!

17:10.130 --> 17:11.630
Fire-control system active.

17:12.080 --> 17:12.880
Target.

17:13.250 --> 17:14.710
Commence tracking.

17:30.790 --> 17:31.920
Was that Regina?!

17:32.330 --> 17:35.500
VLS standby. Proximity beacon.

17:40.830 --> 17:41.790
Launch missiles.

18:00.790 --> 18:02.830
Hey, Leo!

18:06.130 --> 18:07.880
Did you just fly out of that thing?!

18:08.040 --> 18:12.000
Regina said it'd be the fastest
and coolest way to get here!

18:22.830 --> 18:25.830
Miss Selia, can you buy me some time?

18:26.250 --> 18:27.170
Leave it to me.

18:27.750 --> 18:30.040
I'll make sure... to protect you!

18:35.420 --> 18:37.920
With thee at my side, I shall bring my enemies to ruin.

18:40.250 --> 18:42.580
Thy name, fallen to Darkness, is...

18:43.460 --> 18:46.000
...the Demon Sword, Dáinsleif!

18:51.460 --> 18:53.920
Rognas Kingdom School Secret Sword Technique:

18:54.960 --> 18:56.420
Ragna Lost!

19:28.500 --> 19:33.540
For your display of courage as Holy Swordswomen,
I'd like to extend my heartfelt thanks.

19:34.040 --> 19:35.670
We don't deserve such praise.

19:36.630 --> 19:42.080
On behalf of the President of Excalibur Academy's
Executive Council, the pleasure was ours.

19:42.790 --> 19:46.880
By the way, I saw another Holy Swordsman.
A young boy...

19:49.250 --> 19:55.250
Um, he was feeling a bit under the weather,
so we thought it best to send him home.

19:56.130 --> 19:57.380
Oh, I see...

19:58.290 --> 20:02.670
Well, what about the spirit medium
who helped take back control of the ship?

20:02.880 --> 20:05.630
I'd like to express my gratitude to her as well.

20:08.080 --> 20:12.920
Due to extenuating circumstances,
I'm afraid she won't be joining us.

20:15.630 --> 20:18.170
However, she asked me to relay a message.

20:19.670 --> 20:26.710
"I'm absolutely delighted to hear that Your Royal
Highness is safe. I wish you a bright and joyous future."

20:31.880 --> 20:33.580
Ow-ow-ow...

20:35.290 --> 20:38.290
Curses... this nonsense again?

20:39.670 --> 20:43.130
In the end, I wasn't able to gather
any information on the goddess...

20:45.540 --> 20:47.580
I'm here to check up on you!

20:47.750 --> 20:49.920
At least knock, Miss Regina...

20:50.170 --> 20:51.790
How are you feeling?

20:52.000 --> 20:53.880
My muscles are sore, that's all.

20:54.380 --> 20:58.330
I baked you an apple pie!
Here, let your big sis feed it to you!

20:58.540 --> 21:00.250
I can do it myself...

21:00.630 --> 21:03.670
You're bad at accepting help... aren'tcha, kid?

21:03.670 --> 21:04.210
Ouch!

21:05.000 --> 21:08.670
Are you sure about not seeing her?
You could still make it.

21:09.290 --> 21:13.080
Nah, I'm good. It wasn't for very long,
but I got to talk to her.

21:13.460 --> 21:14.920
And it's all 'cause of you.

21:18.630 --> 21:20.790
Did your heart skip a beat?

21:20.790 --> 21:23.000
P-please don't tease me like that...

21:23.380 --> 21:26.290
I'm not teasing you. I'm thanking you.

21:26.880 --> 21:30.380
Just don't tell Lady Selia... 'kay, Leo?

23:06.250 --> 23:09.420
So, why are we sledding across a snowfield right now?

23:09.790 --> 23:11.670
These guys don't get to shine very often.

23:11.880 --> 23:14.710
I'd feel bad if they weren't on TV for as long as possible.

23:14.710 --> 23:16.540
Oh, how thoughtful of you!

23:16.710 --> 23:20.250
Also, the studio went to the trouble of designing them,
so it'd be a waste not to use them.

23:20.250 --> 23:22.080
Oh, how moneyless of you...

23:22.080 --> 23:24.580
We share an extremely profound bond of friendship.

23:24.830 --> 23:26.880
That's why they obey my every command.

23:27.290 --> 23:28.580
All together now: Brake!

23:33.000 --> 23:35.000
Hey, cut the cameras!

23:46.880 --> 23:50.920
<b>THE CITY RUINS APPEAR</b>
